msgstr "https://www.wpbookingsystem.com/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid ""
"Allow customers to pay with any of the payment methods available through "
"Mollie."
msgstr "Engedélyezd, hogy a vásárlók a Mollie-n keresztül elérhető bármely fizetési móddal fizessenek."

#. Author of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid "Veribo, Roland Murg"
msgstr "Veribo, Roland Murg"

#: includes/base/admin/booking/functions.php:46
#: includes/base/admin/booking/functions.php:50
msgid "Open in Mollie"
msgstr "Megnyitás a Mollie-ban"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:11
msgid "Mollie"
msgstr "Mollie"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:12
msgid ""
"Give the customer the option to pay through any of the payment gateways "
"supported by Mollie."
msgstr "Adj a vásárlónak lehetőséget, hogy a Mollie által támogatott bármely fizetési átjárón keresztül fizessen."

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:18
msgid "Enable Mollie"
msgstr "Mollie engedélyezése"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:36
msgid "Display name"
msgstr "Megjelenített név"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:45
msgid "The payment method name that appears on the booking form."
msgstr "A foglalási űrlapon megjelenő fizetési mód neve."

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:72
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Leírás"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:79
msgid "The payment method description that appears on the booking form."
msgstr "A foglalási űrlapon megjelenő fizetési mód leírása."

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:106
msgid "Invoice Item Name"
msgstr "Számlatétel neve"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:113
msgid ""
"The name of the product that appears on the Mollie invoice. Eg. \"Booking at"
" Anne's house.\""
msgstr "A Mollie számlán megjelenő termék neve. Pl.: „Foglalás Anne házában.”"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:138
msgid "API Credentials"
msgstr "API-hitelesítő adatok"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:142
msgid ""
"If you need help getting your API Keys, <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://www.wpbookingsystem.com/documentation/mollie-"
"integration/\">check out our guide</a> which offers step by step "
"instructions."
msgstr "Ha segítségre van szükséged az API-kulcsok beszerzéséhez, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.wpbookingsystem.com/documentation/mollie-integration/\">nézd meg az útmutatónkat</a>, amely lépésről lépésre bemutatja a teendőket."

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:148
msgid "Enable Test Mode"
msgstr "Tesztmód bekapcsolása"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:160
msgid ""
"We recommend enabling test mode and testing the payment integration before "
"going live."
msgstr "Javasoljuk a tesztmód bekapcsolását és a fizetési integráció tesztelését az élesítés előtt."

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:166
msgid "Profile ID"
msgstr "Profil ID"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:177
msgid "Test API Key"
msgstr "Teszt API-kulcs"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-mollie.php:189
msgid "Live API Key"
msgstr "Éles API-kulcs"

